[38;2;124;124;124mLet $P(x,y)$ denote the assertion.[0m

[38;2;124;124;124m$P(x,y): f(x+f(x+y)) + f(xy) = x + f(x+y) + yf(x)$[0m

[38;2;124;124;124mLet me try some substitutions.[0m

[38;2;124;124;124m$P(x, 0): f(x+f(x)) + f(0) = x + f(x) + 0 \cdot f(x) = x + f(x)$[0m

[38;2;124;124;124mSo $f(x+f(x)) = x + f(x) - f(0)$. Let $c = f(0)$.[0m

[38;2;124;124;124m$P(0, y): f(0+f(y)) + f(0) = 0 + f(y) + yf(0)$[0m
[38;2;124;124;124m$f(f(y)) + c = f(y) + yc$[0m
[38;2;124;124;124m$f(f(y)) = f(y) + yc - c = f(y) + c(y-1)$[0m

[38;2;124;124;124m$P(0,0): f(f(0)) + f(0) = 0 + f(0) + 0$[0m
[38;2;124;124;124m$f(c) + c = c$[0m
[38;2;124;124;124m$f(c) = 0$[0m

[38;2;124;124;124mFrom $f(f(y)) = f(y) + c(y-1)$, setting $y=0$: $f(f(0)) = f(0) + c(-1) = c - c =[0m[38;2;124;124;124m0$. Consistent with $f(c)=0$.[0m

[38;2;124;124;124mNow let me guess $f$ is linear: $f(x) = ax + b$.[0m
[38;2;124;124;124mThen $c = f(0) = b$.[0m
[38;2;124;124;124m$f(f(y)) = a(ay+b)+b = a^2 y + ab + b$.[0m
[38;2;124;124;124mAnd $f(y) + c(y-1) = ay + b + b(y-1) = ay + b + by - b = (a+b)y$.[0m
